/v1/","context":{"app_id":3517930,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3517930","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:54:53Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3938130","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1846651706691388","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"Nemorsys: Next Fest Is Open","summary":"Light exposes you. Shadow arms you. Steam Next Fest is open, October 19 to 26, and the Nemorsys demo is in it. Nemorsys is a punishing stealth-action RPG where ambient light drives all of it: your abilities, what every enemy can see and every route through a room. Charge in and you die. Snuff the lights, work the dark, and that same room becomes yours. If you tried the demo earlier this year, this is not the demo you played. The skill system has been rebuilt around tier-based progression, with t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1844751498227721","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"Nemorsys Joins the Steam Next Fest on October 19","summary":"Nemorsys is joining the Steam Next Fest on October 19, and the demo has received several major improvements to highlight the event.New shadow character shaders with outline for improved contrastEnhanced main environment textures for a cleaner, more polished lookAdjusted camera zoom for being closer to the main characterFully revamped skill system with tier‑based progressionRandomized skill options each run for increased replayabilityFull gamepad support added to the demoRevamped starting skill f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T17:46:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227721","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1844115010493022","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"Nemorsys is part of Soul Sale Fest @CrunchingKoalas","summary":"Nemorsys is part of the Soul Sale Fest organized by @CrunchingKoalas! It’s a tough, challenging game, and for those who truly embrace a challenge… and aren't afraid of death: just wait until you see the brutal mode in the full release.Our new update brings extra polish, a new shadow outline, and a redesigned skill tree UI, players must now unlock skills tier-by-tier rather than having everything available at once.! Jump in, test your adaptability, and see if you can face the gauntlet.Download th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T18:50:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1836506165548809","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"The Steam Summer Sale Is On Now!","summary":"The Steam Summer Sale is on now, running June 25 to July 9! Don't forget to wishlist Nemorsys now. While you wait, check out great deals on other indie.io titles during the Summer Sale to add to your collection. https://store.steampowered.com/app/3517930/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-25T10:36:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165548809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1831432155578918","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"update","title":"New Demo Update","summary":"New Demo Update — Fully Revamped Introduction ExperienceThe previous demo dropped players directly into the heart of Level 3, showcasing several advanced abilities right away. While this offered a fast look at the core systems, it also proved overwhelming for many players who were discovering the game for the first time.To provide a smoother onboarding and a more authentic first impression, the demo has been completely rebuilt.Start From the True Beginning of the GameThe demo now begins with the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-05T00:15:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578918","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1830163047268810","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo launches April 22 — Step into the shadows","summary":"Core gameplay systemsIn this demo, you will experience Nemorsys’ core mechanic: The in-game shadow and light is the source of all your powers .AbilitiesYou will have access to 6 out of 25 total in-game skills, all influenced by the Light and Shadow system. This allows experimentation with different combat and traversal approaches depending on your form.Form Players must adapt their form to match the environment in order to optimize their powers:Shadow Form (Nemorsys)Stealth-based movementSafer n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-21T15:02:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047268810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1823191198617501","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"Chaolys x Indie.io","summary":"Nemorsys has grown into an ambitious project, and we want to ensure it launches with the impact it deserves. To help us cross the finish line with maximum polish, Indie.io is now supporting us with marketing, professional QA, localization, and expert launch guidance so Nemorsys can reach players worldwide at the quality level it deserves.We chose Indie.io because they truly believe in the world we’re building and respect our creative independence. The vision, tone, and gameplay remain entirely o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-03T18:48:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198617501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1821288646588953","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"update","title":"Update","summary":"Gameplay AdjustmentsBlinding Light now has a minimum range and minimum power (no longer drops to 0).The Nemorsys now starts with Shadowform at Normal difficulty.Shadowform color updated to purple for better visual clarity.Blue Orbs now explode while in shadowCharacters now drop Shards of Hatred upon death, which restore health and convert to XP when your health is full.User Interface & UXAdded a clue message in the tutorial if the player remains stuck too long at the plank‑placement step.All upg","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-13T21:30:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646588953","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1819386365111803","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"update","title":"Update","summary":"Patch NotesThe player is now purple when standing in shadows to better distinguish them from enemies.The player’s trail now matches the player’s shadow color.Added missing colliders to various map elements.Fixed the decoy color for the Phantom skill.Repositioned several torches.Removed the Kill all rats effect at the end of the \"Rat Area\".Crimson Curse: The curse no longer triggers on the player when a decoy enters a crimson trap. Decoys are now destroyed by the trap instead.The Change of Heart ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-28T17:42:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365111803","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1818752592126205","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"update","title":"Major Update","summary":"This update brings gameplay refinements, visual upgrades, and system optimizations across the tutorial and early levels.Gameplay & SystemsRat spawners now activate even when the player is far from the nest.Tutorial rat spawner now correctly triggers only within its designated zone.Fog of War and Stealth systems now support dynamic resizing during gameplay.Mouse-over interactions have been reinforced for greater reliability.Guard on top tower now has an expanded field of view.Player trail length ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-12T05:24:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592126205","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1810503566486357","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"new gameplay trailer","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-13T15:44:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566486357","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3517930-1810503566386490","game_id":"steam-3517930","kind":"announcement","title":"Nemorsys (New gameplay trailer) + major updates","summary":"Major Updates:Smoother Field of View: Improved visual transitions and camera movement for a more immersive experience.Skills Overhaul: Revamped skill system featuring 25 unique and rebalanced skills.UI Overhaul: A redesigned user interface for better clarity, accessibility, and aesthetics.Village Atmosphere Enhancements: Chickens and birds added to bring more life and realism to the environment.New Event: Solving a clue may now trigger a surprise zombie attack, adding tension and unpredictabilit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-10T15:09:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566386490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3517930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3517930":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3517930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3938130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:41:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3517930","app_id":3517930,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw